---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: products-nonslip.html
title: 논슬립
description: 계단과 경사로의 안전한 보행을 위한 하이탑 논슬립 제품군입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <picture class="absolute inset-0 block h-full w-full">
    <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="{{ '/images/products/nonslip/diamond.jpg' | url }}">
    <img src="{{ '/images/home/nonslip-install-01.jpg' | url }}" alt="계단에 시공된 하이탑 논슬립 제품"
         class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_82%]" width="330" height="178" fetchpriority="high">
  </picture>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/50"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/70 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="브레드크럼" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">홈</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">논슬립</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Non-Slip</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">논슬립</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="product-index" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Product Portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">보행 환경에 맞춘 11개 제품군</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        계단·교량 보도·경사로 등 적용 장소와 하중 조건을 고려해 소재와 구성을 선택할 수 있습니다.
        각 제품의 주요 소재와 적용 환경을 함께 확인해 보세요.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for p in products.nonslip %}
        <article class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-line transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:ring-primary/20 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(25,28,29,0.10)]">
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden bg-section">
            <img src="{{ p.img | url }}" alt="{{ p.nameKo }}"
                 class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
                 loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/65 via-transparent to-night/10"></div>
            <span class="absolute left-5 top-4 font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-white/70">{{ p.num }}</span>
            <span class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/65">{{ p.nameEn }}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink">{{ p.nameKo }}</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ p.desc }}</p>

            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-line ring-1 ring-line">
              <div class="bg-surface px-3.5 py-3">
                <p class="font-display text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary/65">Material</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-ink">{{ p.mat }}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-surface px-3.5 py-3">
                <p class="font-display text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary/65">Application</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-ink">{{ p.env }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 flex-1">
              {% for f in p.features %}
                <div class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-2 border-t border-ink/10 py-3 {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %}">
                  <span class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold text-accent">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
                  <p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/75">{{ f }}</p>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <span class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-secondary/60">Performance</span>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-primary/15 bg-primary/[0.05] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-primary">{{ p.remark }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-b border-line bg-white py-14 lg:py-18">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Procurement Information</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">상세 규격과 물품식별번호 안내</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-secondary">
          논슬립 제품의 상세 규격과 조달청 물품식별번호, 사양서는 제품 문의를 통해 안내해 드립니다.
          설치 장소와 사용 환경을 알려주시면 현장 조건에 맞는 제품을 검토할 수 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "적합한 논슬립 제품을 찾고 계신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "현장 환경과 조건을 알려주시면 적용 가능한 제품과 규격을 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "교량이음장치 보기", url: "/products-bridge.html" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
